comments.body:
@doc77 That does work, but only with specific navigation apps that already have multi window enabled.

So, for example, Google Maps works great like that, but my sat nav of choice is Waze as I find it much better at calculating alternative routes, avoiding traffic etc, but it does not seem to support multi window.

I figured it would probably be easier getting an app like xDrip updated to use multi window than something like Waze made by a huge company (which in this case is Google!)
